      "updated": 1753031230019,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agentic Systems\nWorkflows\n    - Prompt chaining\n    - Routing\n    - Parallelization\n    - Reflection\n    - Orchestrator-worker\nTools\n    - Tool calling\n    - Tool execution\n    - MCP\nMulti-step Agents\n    - ReACT\n    - Reflexion\n    . etc\nMulti-agents\n    - deep research\n    - A2A protocols\nAgentic frameworks: \n    - LangChain, LangGraph, rivet, vellum, etc.\n\nProject 3: Build an ask-the-web agent",
      "fontSize": 22.550180288461547,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agentic Systems\nWorkflows\n    - Prompt chaining\n    - Routing\n    - Parallelization\n    - Reflection\n    - Orchestrator-worker\nTools\n    - Tool calling\n    - Tool execution\n    - MCP\nMulti-step Agents\n    - ReACT\n    - Reflexion\n    . etc\nMulti-agents\n    - deep research\n    - A2A protocols\nAgentic frameworks: \n    - LangChain, LangGraph, rivet, vellum, etc.\n\nProject 3: Build an ask-the-web agent",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
