    },
    {
      "id": "Ef0RV495XbhL-ztsxNVf4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6354.9881079546385,
      "y": 3948.7357158828963,
      "width": 594.0982839584311,
      "height": 56.21093749999978,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 203064651,
      "version": 585,
      "versionNonce": 2020978571,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753030215664,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If workflow is designed carefully, it can engage in\ntasks requiring multi-step reasoning and planning.",
      "fontSize": 22.484374999999904,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If workflow is designed carefully, it can engage in tasks requiring multi-step reasoning and planning.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nnEnmEcqTGc3poIbdBj7L",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8324.062216514454,
      "y": 3960.9857148850497,
      "width": 370.1796875,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227818693,
      "version": 248,
      "versionNonce": 786787973,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753030892955,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Information Processing Workflows: \n    - Transformation 1\n    - Transformation 2\n    - etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Information Processing Workflows: \n    - Transformation 1\n    - Transformation 2\n    - etc.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BwJRYD_WhWRw4xiC2NhY4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8320.203167035286,
      "y": 3828.583603649931,
      "width": 589.65966796875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bky",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 468428811,
      "version": 206,
      "versionNonce": 1653682117,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753030891039,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Data extraction workflows: \n    - The conversion of unstructured text into a structured\n    format is typically a sequential process.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Data extraction workflows: \n    - The conversion of unstructured text into a structured\n    format is typically a sequential process.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3b3bpIWj4tZpGU4ung76m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8320.160384297193,
      "y": 3680.3279302868364,
      "width": 513.1396484375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bkz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1565915909,
      "version": 148,
      "versionNonce": 408851173,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753030772564,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Content generation workflows: \n    - Writing an outline of a document\n    - checking that the outline meets certain criteria\n    - writing the document based on the outline.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Content generation workflows: \n    - Writing an outline of a document\n    - checking that the outline meets certain criteria\n    - writing the document based on the outline.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_PWZGSDsDcEXR5VPb_K0a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4854.358217005041,
      "y": 3476.155217940564,
      "width": 841.6195068359375,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bl0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 665522565,
      "version": 386,
      "versionNonce": 1704302475,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753029959282,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For complex tasks, a single prompt can overwhelm LLMs. The high cognitive load might:\n    - Neglect parts of the instruction\n    - Context drift: LLM loses track of the initial context\n    - Error propagation\n    - Hallucination due to increased cognitive load",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For complex tasks, a single prompt can overwhelm LLMs. The high cognitive load might:\n    - Neglect parts of the instruction\n    - Context drift: LLM loses track of the initial context\n    - Error propagation\n    - Hallucination due to increased cognitive load",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
