      "updated": 1753042456655,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Rule-based: Pre-defined rules or logics (if/else statements)\n\n- ML-based: Employ a traditional ML model to determine the intent (classifier) \n\n- Embedding similarity: query -> embedding -> nearest specialized embedding.\nUseful for semantic routing\n\n- LLM Routers: Prompt an LLM to classify the intent \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Rule-based: Pre-defined rules or logics (if/else statements)\n\n- ML-based: Employ a traditional ML model to determine the intent (classifier) \n\n- Embedding similarity: query -> embedding -> nearest specialized embedding. Useful for semantic routing\n\n- LLM Routers: Prompt an LLM to classify the intent \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
