      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753047222391,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Check for:\n    - factual accuracy\n    - coherence, style\n    - completeness\n    - adherence to instructions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Check for:\n    - factual accuracy\n    - coherence, style\n    - completeness\n    - adherence to instructions",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BjE27mWUexzRScmVaQRF1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7083.167384996414,
      "y": 6582.264929834003,
      "width": 595.8197195870542,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bms",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1734956939,
      "version": 509,
      "versionNonce": 614557579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753047742137,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "While a single LLM can perform\nself-reflection, using two specialized LLM might be more\nrobust and lead to unbiased results.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "While a single LLM can perform\nself-reflection, using two specialized LLM might be more robust and lead to unbiased results.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EUMobGtXRspSrwNsUeT36",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6205.310800174988,
      "y": 5867.340404164359,
      "width": 305.3848615373881,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bmt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 192394117,
      "version": 366,
      "versionNonce": 1071596037,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753047078106,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Primary responsibility: Process\nthe conversation and generate\na correct solution.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Primary responsibility: Process the conversation and generate a correct solution.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
