    {
      "id": "N4U2EkTyceRSt6IVg0ziM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17488.62891555701,
      "y": 858.7677839563574,
      "width": 302.32788085937506,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "br7",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 111789253,
      "version": 512,
      "versionNonce": 44267173,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "SODDvzH5m73wwOdepn2Ms",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1753209990055,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agents leverage tools such as\nweb browsers, APIs,\ndatabases, Python execution,\nfile systems or custom\nfunctions.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agents leverage tools such as web browsers, APIs, databases, Python execution, file systems or custom functions.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dC0CFZ-pMOH_VuMXKutv-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 17725.18357534085,
      "y": -222.83119692065884,
      "width": 561.9772949218748,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 72552043,
      "version": 623,
      "versionNonce": 1398640581,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753210066289,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "For example, an agent might analyze a customer’s\nmessage, decide to retrieve information from a database,\nand generate a response, all without a fixed script.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "For example, an agent might analyze a customer’s message, decide to retrieve information from a database, and generate a response, all without a fixed script.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "QrEVAQ_E91CDPlJfZ8x-n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15748.354983740788,
      "y": 1192.222492968951,
      "width": 958.9193725585938,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "brL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 470055109,
      "version": 269,
      "versionNonce": 2069366795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753205143857,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Agents work in a continuous cycle of: thinking (Thought) → acting (Act) and observing (Observe).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Agents work in a continuous cycle of: thinking (Thought) → acting (Act) and observing (Observe).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
